<p>Hussain imaam hussain</p>

<p>Hussain imaam hussain aye mere imaam hussain<br />
Hussain imaam hussainaa, tashnakaam hussain</p>

<p>1) Hussain deen panah laailaaha illallah<br />
Hussain haq ki baqa laailaaha illallah<br />
agar hussain nahi deen ko baqa hi nahi<br />
binaaye deene khuda hai tere naam hussain</p>

<p>
 2) Baqaaye deene khuda hai tumhaari qurbaani<br />
 tumhaare naam se zida hai doure eemaani<br />
 kiya wo sabr hui zulm ko paashemaani<br />
 aye shaahe karbobla ho tujhe salaam hussain<br />
 </p>

<p>3) Payaame shaah karo aam har zamaane me<br />
lutaaya shaah ne sab kuch ise bachaane me<br />
panah dee'n ko mili hai isi gharaane me<br />
jo zere teghbhi le bas khuda ka naam hussain</p>

<p>
 4) Meri najaat ki haamil hai ye azaadari<br />
 meri hayaat ka haasil hai ye azaadaari<br />
 hamaare khoon me shaamil hai ye azaadari<br />
 har ek hayaat ka lamha hai tere naam hussain</p>

<p>
5) Jo alhe zulm hai sar kaise wo uthaaenge<br />
kahi'n amaa'n na milegi jaha'n wo jaaenge<br />
jo zulfeqaar ki zad par hai bach na paayenge<br />
karega aake jo hujjat tera qayaam hussain</p>

<p>
 6) Ghame hussain ki zehno me tum ziya rakhna<br />
 lagaaye seene se tum qaake karbala rakhna<br />
 sajaaye parchame ghazi ko tum sada rakhna<br />
 karenge hashr talak gham tere ghulaam hussain</p>

<p>
7) Kare ye zindagi ham se agar wafa hyder<br />
hazaar baar karu jaan ye fida hyder<br />
hussaini hone ka humko mile sila hyder<br />
azaae shaah me ho saans ye tamaam hussain</p>